Statement of changes (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)), 2026-11-12:

  * plugins/grok-build/scripts/session-lifecycle-hook.mjs: appendEnvVar no
    longer appends to CLAUDE_ENV_FILE. It reads the file, adds the new export,
    keeps only the last export of every variable (other lines are left as they
    are) and writes the file back only when it changed.
  * tests/session-env-file.test.mjs: new tests for the above.
  * Marketplace renamed from "xai-grok-build" to "rionmint-grok-build";
    version 0.2.1-rionmint.1 in package.json, plugin.json and marketplace.json;
    plugin author shown as "xAI (rionmint fork)".
  * README.md: a fork note at the top.

